{"id":47769,"date":"2026-01-06T21:37:49","date_gmt":"2026-01-06T20:37:49","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=47769"},"modified":"2026-09-27T13:21:27","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T12:21:27","slug":"lynxrace-mafra","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/lynxrace-mafra\/","title":{"rendered":"Lynxrace Mafra 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Lynxrace Mafra 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Lynxrace Mafra 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>27 de Setembro de 2026<\/strong>, no cen\u00e1rio imponente e exclusivo da <strong>Tapada Militar de Mafra<\/strong>. A prova integra o prestigiado Circuito Lynx e desafia atletas de todos os n\u00edveis a superarem obst\u00e1culos naturais e militares no cora\u00e7\u00e3o da natureza.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com partida e chegada no <strong>Campo dos Pl\u00e1tanos (Lynx Village)<\/strong>, o evento disp\u00f5e de percursos na vertente <strong>Competitive<\/strong> (para atletas que procuram tempos cronometrados, supera\u00e7\u00e3o rigorosa e p\u00f3dio) e <strong>Open<\/strong> (orientada para a divers\u00e3o, esp\u00edrito de equipa e entreajuda), al\u00e9m da corrida dedicada <strong>Lynx Kids<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva Lynx<\/strong>, garantindo uma estrutura de seguran\u00e7a e apoio exemplar, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica Stop&#038;Go, abastecimentos e um ambiente vibrante de supera\u00e7\u00e3o desportiva.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">27 de Setembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; ga